WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:00.000
[title sign]

00:00.000 --> 00:00.000
{urn}

00:00.000 --> 00:00.000
{reciept}

00:00.000 --> 00:00.000
{ed01}

00:02.890 --> 00:07.680
Our match with Rikkaidai has been postponed for three days due to circumstances at the courts.

00:07.680 --> 00:10.360
However, let's not get carel-

00:09.320 --> 00:12.280
Cheers!

00:12.280 --> 00:13.380
Let's dig in!

00:13.380 --> 00:15.240
Hey, Shorty! You want some?

00:20.200 --> 00:21.660
Is that okay?

00:21.660 --> 00:24.580
Today, we're celebrating advancing to the finals.

00:24.580 --> 00:25.720
Yup!

00:25.720 --> 00:29.090
So tonight, let's leave all that strict stuff out!

00:31.770 --> 00:33.050
Eh? Shorty?

00:33.050 --> 00:35.700
You haven't been using the dipping sauce.

00:38.040 --> 00:40.720
It tastes better with just salt, after all. {Majic_Lord suggests: it tastes better with just salt after all}{<Magic_Lord> pronounciation just be smoothed <Magic_Lord> since his pronounciation is not that bad}

00:42.410 --> 00:44.640
You're so sassy for a mere shorty!

00:44.640 --> 00:46.600
The hell you say!?

00:46.600 --> 00:49.380
A real man would splash it around in the sauce!

00:49.380 --> 00:50.610
Shut the hell up!

00:50.610 --> 00:52.280
If I say it's better with salt, then salt it is!

00:53.190 --> 00:54.910
You wanna fight!?

00:54.910 --> 00:56.270
Bring it on!

00:56.270 --> 00:57.610
I'll beat you black and blue!

00:57.610 --> 01:01.580
Now, now, isn't it fine either way, you two?

01:01.580 --> 01:02.750
No.

01:02.750 --> 01:04.540
This is an important issue.

01:05.080 --> 01:07.010
You're of the sauce persuasion, Fuji?

01:07.010 --> 01:08.210
How unexpected.

01:08.210 --> 01:11.260
The combination of both the soothing and spicy properties of the sauce...

01:11.260 --> 01:14.980
plays an exquisite symphony that warms my soul.

01:14.980 --> 01:17.430
I can't get enough of this heart-throbbing sensation!

01:18.970 --> 01:22.710
Besides, you can always eat plain meat with salt when you're old.

01:23.900 --> 01:26.940
It would seem you're still unable to see it.

01:26.940 --> 01:29.380
I'm of the reversible persuasion. {*both of us are biting our tongues here.. he seriously says this.. literally*}

01:32.400 --> 01:35.080
I wonder which persuasion I should pick.

01:35.080 --> 01:36.070
You guys...

01:37.740 --> 01:39.910
O-Oishi?

01:40.310 --> 01:41.850
You guys...

01:41.850 --> 01:44.660
Just say what the name of this cuisine is.

01:44.660 --> 01:46.160
Name?

01:46.160 --> 01:48.680
Is this cuisine called "sauce meat"?

01:48.680 --> 01:49.920
Or is it called "salt meat"?

01:49.920 --> 01:51.920
No, it's yakiniku!

01:51.920 --> 01:54.170
Do you even know what that means?

01:54.540 --> 01:55.670
Means?

01:55.670 --> 01:56.550
It's yakiniku!

01:56.550 --> 01:58.310
You stupid-!

01:58.310 --> 02:00.290
The main part is neither salt nor sauce!

02:00.290 --> 02:01.360
It's grilling!

02:01.360 --> 02:07.390
Yakiniku is meat cooked in its own juices!

02:07.390 --> 02:08.400
Echizen!

02:08.400 --> 02:11.350
You're supposed to grill beef tongue for 30 seconds
 on one side and 15 seconds on the other, right!?

02:11.350 --> 02:12.020
Yes!

02:12.020 --> 02:12.880
Momo!

02:12.880 --> 02:15.490
Is there any other guy who would splash his meat around in the sauce that much!?

02:15.490 --> 02:16.860
I'm sorry!

02:17.240 --> 02:17.930
Fuji!

02:17.930 --> 02:19.910
Compensate for the saltiness by using hot pepper paste!

02:19.910 --> 02:21.370
Y-Yeah, okay.

02:21.650 --> 02:22.480
Tezuka!

02:22.480 --> 02:25.380
You should smooth the taste of your beef tripe by grilling it a bit more!

02:25.380 --> 02:27.370
S-Seems like it.

02:27.370 --> 02:28.450
It's no good!

02:28.450 --> 02:29.580
There's no going against him!

02:30.250 --> 02:31.160
This is...  Oishi Territory.

02:31.160 --> 02:33.250
This is... {alpha} Oishi Territory.

02:33.250 --> 02:35.170
No, that's wrong.

02:36.800 --> 02:38.520
He's the Yakiniku Magistrate.

02:50.330 --> 02:53.520
What's that? Seigaku's having meat?

02:54.010 --> 02:55.080
What?

02:55.080 --> 02:57.440
Those shrimps are having yakiniku?

02:58.570 --> 03:00.610
Echizen-kun and Seigaku are having yakiniku?

03:00.610 --> 03:03.450
To be eating meat... Oh, what a feast!

03:03.450 --> 03:06.870
Yeah, I'm gonna feast too!

03:12.290 --> 03:15.150
Rokkaku Middle School and Higa Middle School?

03:15.150 --> 03:18.330
Even Shitenhouji? Why are they here?

03:26.950 --> 03:30.100
Hey, hey, just what kind of party is this?

03:30.100 --> 03:31.560
And so...

03:31.970 --> 03:36.760
We will be holding the Rival School All-You-Can-Eat Yakiniku Battle!

03:37.420 --> 03:40.110
Your play-by-play commentators will be me, Kikumaru Eiji, and...

03:40.110 --> 03:42.880
Oshitari Yushi, at your ser-

03:42.880 --> 03:44.180
Wait, why should I?{splitted by limp}

03:44.180 --> 03:45.360
Well, then let's get started!

03:45.360 --> 03:48.490
The six-member teams chosen to participate from each school are as follows:

03:50.380 --> 03:51.650
First we have Seigaku!

03:51.650 --> 03:54.160
Speaking of big eaters, Momoshiro Takeshi!

03:54.160 --> 03:56.660
There's no way I can lose.

03:56.660 --> 03:58.130
There's just no way.

03:58.130 --> 04:01.950
Next up, our cheeky super rookie, Echizen Ryoma!

04:01.950 --> 04:03.000
'Sup.

04:03.000 --> 04:06.290
Then there's the currently recognized Yakiniku Magistrate, Oishi Shuichiro!

04:06.290 --> 04:08.260
Meat full on! {Solo-  Please have it TLC'd}

04:08.260 --> 04:11.410
I don't think we'll be able to use Synchro today.

04:11.410 --> 04:13.840
Moving on, we have Inui Sadaharu!

04:14.660 --> 04:17.090
Next is our resident genius, Fuji Shusuke!

04:17.090 --> 04:18.680
I wonder if he'll be okay.

04:20.030 --> 04:22.890
Lastly, we have our captain, Tezuka Kunimitsu!

04:22.890 --> 04:24.780
Everyone, let's not get carel-

04:24.780 --> 04:27.410
That concludes the amazing six-member battle formation of Seigaku!

04:29.010 --> 04:30.980
Next up is Higa Middle School.

04:30.980 --> 04:34.350
What traps did the "killer," Kite Eishirou, set up today?

04:34.350 --> 04:37.170
It would be best if everyone was thoroughly prepared.

04:37.620 --> 04:40.050
And onto the Viking Horn, Kai Yuujirou!

04:40.050 --> 04:43.280
Could it be that you also hold your chopsticks in your left hand with a reverse grip?

04:43.280 --> 04:44.420
Obviously.

04:44.420 --> 04:47.540
Now we have the lone wolf who hates Go-Ya despite being from Okinawa.

04:47.540 --> 04:49.180
Hirakoba Rin! {ambient: split line}

04:49.600 --> 04:52.250
Creepy in every way since he's unpredictable.

04:52.250 --> 04:53.930
Chinen Hiroshi!

04:54.140 --> 04:57.190
The number one free-diver, Shiranui Tomoya!

04:57.190 --> 04:58.690
And lastly we have the big favorite.

04:58.690 --> 05:01.510
If it were up to me, he'd take the cake, hands down.

05:01.510 --> 05:02.830
Tanishi Kei.

05:02.830 --> 05:04.940
I'll start attacking now! {use whatever key phrase you guys used during his game with Ryoma.. we're too lazy to look it up. O.o}

05:06.880 --> 05:09.920
Third up are the chummy guys from Rokkaku Middle School.

05:09.920 --> 05:13.270
To begin, we have their captain, Aoi Kentarou.

05:13.270 --> 05:14.250
Looking forward to it!

05:14.810 --> 05:16.900
Next, Amane "David" Hikaru.

05:17.560 --> 05:20.040
I'm <i>going</i> to win at eating <i>meat</i>. {the pun is niku (meat) and going (ni iku)}{TL Note: Amane is punning on the words "niku" (meat) and "ni iku" (going).}

05:20.750 --> 05:21.540
Hey!

05:21.540 --> 05:24.130
And just like that, you can count on him for his straight man act.

05:24.130 --> 05:27.080
Kurobane "Bane-san" Harukaze. {ambient: split after "act"}

05:27.080 --> 05:29.090
This next man is quite uselessly handsome, isn't he?

05:29.090 --> 05:30.650
Saeki Koujirou.

05:30.650 --> 05:32.010
The "uselessly" wasn't necessary.

05:32.310 --> 05:34.180
I can't believe the way he breathes from his nose.

05:34.180 --> 05:35.810
Itsuki Marehiko.

05:37.140 --> 05:40.400
Considering he doesn't really have any presence, is he going to be all right?

05:40.400 --> 05:41.610
Shudou Satoshi.

05:44.910 --> 05:47.160
Continuing on, we have Osaka's Shitenhouji.

05:47.160 --> 05:49.730
Their captain, Shiraishi Kuranosuke.

05:50.570 --> 05:51.780
Ecstasy!

05:51.780 --> 05:53.730
He even eats his meals fast.

05:53.730 --> 05:56.890
Naniwa's speed star, Oshitari Kenya.

05:57.570 --> 06:02.010
The Saikikanpatsu and ever notorious Muga Maniac, Chitose Senri.

06:02.010 --> 06:05.590
This is going be an interesting encounter. I'm glad to participate!

06:05.840 --> 06:10.550
Broken hearted after being dumped by Kotaru, the copycat, Hitoji Yuuji.

06:10.850 --> 06:14.340
He uses 108 styles of Hadoukyuu and his right hand to eat.{if memory serves me right, he's a left handed player.. up to you if you wanna put a note about this.} {TL Note: Oshitari is making a point about Gin eating with his right hand because he is a left-handed player.}

06:14.340 --> 06:15.810
Ishida Gin.

06:16.370 --> 06:19.940
The East's Super Contact Rookie, Toyama Kintaro.{get one of yr tlcers to listen to this.. we've both listened way too many times and cant tell what the hell that middle word is. It sounds like gontakure...whatever that means...}

06:19.940 --> 06:22.610
I hafta get another match against Koshimae!

06:24.530 --> 06:26.910
Lastly, we have my school, Hyotei.

06:26.910 --> 06:29.260
Is there a meat that suits his tongue?

06:29.260 --> 06:30.740
Atobe Keigo.

06:30.740 --> 06:33.030
Wait, what's up with your hair?

06:34.120 --> 06:37.240
That's what you call a "king's secret."

06:37.240 --> 06:38.620
That makes absolutely no sense.

06:38.890 --> 06:41.960
The moon-saulting Mukahi Gakuto!

06:41.960 --> 06:45.130
Rather, that really has nothing to do with eating.

06:45.830 --> 06:48.350
Even if he just eats a little, this guy will fall asleep for sure.

06:48.350 --> 06:49.720
Akutagawa Jirou.

06:50.310 --> 06:53.080
The Gekokujyou man, Hiyoshi Wakashi.

06:53.080 --> 06:54.220
The enemy is outside... outside.

06:54.970 --> 06:56.900
You can leave all the effort and guts to him.

06:56.900 --> 06:57.920
Shishido Ryou.

06:57.920 --> 06:59.890
When you lose, the gap will be huge.{Need to find this.. he says it often.. go back over old eps.}

06:59.890 --> 07:02.470
Lastly, Kabaji Munehiro.

07:02.470 --> 07:03.860
Yup.

07:03.860 --> 07:07.190
Somehow, it doesn't feel like he has the winning spirit.

07:07.790 --> 07:09.510
The rules are simple.

07:09.510 --> 07:14.160
The team that eats the most within an hour wins.

07:14.160 --> 07:15.880
The one who wins is elegant-

07:15.880 --> 07:19.080
No, the one who eats is elegant, right?

07:19.080 --> 07:20.410
However...

07:20.410 --> 07:27.130
You must drink one cup of Inui's special juice to start, then drink another cup after ten plates.

07:27.130 --> 07:29.130
T-There it is!

07:29.800 --> 07:33.760
No matter what, we must not lose to Higa Middle School.

07:35.070 --> 07:37.180
We'll be sure to turn the tables on ya!

07:37.180 --> 07:38.290
Dumbass.

07:38.290 --> 07:39.720
The winners will clearly be us, Hyo-

07:39.720 --> 07:39.720
Hurry up!

07:40.190 --> 07:41.690
I wanna eat Mr. Cow!

07:42.250 --> 07:43.970
Ready... Fight!

07:43.970 --> 07:44.600
Ready... {alpha}Fight!

07:45.120 --> 07:47.050
To start, the first drink is...

07:47.050 --> 07:49.030
Inui's Special Vegetable Juice!

07:49.030 --> 07:51.500
It looks super yummy!

07:51.500 --> 07:53.180
Leave this one to me!

07:53.180 --> 07:54.950
That's not fair, Kenya!

07:55.870 --> 07:57.350
<i>I wonder why...</i>

07:57.350 --> 07:59.300
<i>Even though I've never drunk it...</i>

07:59.300 --> 08:03.460
<i>I have this faint feeling buried deep within my memories that says it's incredibly dangerous.</i>

08:06.010 --> 08:07.920
I-It's just my imagination, right?

08:08.580 --> 08:10.130
Just my imagination.

08:17.140 --> 08:18.390
Kentarou!

08:23.390 --> 08:25.460
That guy is totally overreacting.

08:25.460 --> 08:27.810
Something like this green juice...

08:27.810 --> 08:29.270
Wait, Mukahi!

08:32.310 --> 08:33.030
Gakuto!

08:38.700 --> 08:39.760
I dun want it!

08:39.760 --> 08:41.630
You drink it, Kenya!

08:41.630 --> 08:42.720
That's right!

08:42.720 --> 08:45.240
Shiraishi, you're watching your health, so why don't you drink it?

08:45.860 --> 08:47.540
My stomach hurts.

08:47.540 --> 08:49.210
Then don't eat meat!

08:52.170 --> 08:53.610
That is...

08:53.610 --> 08:55.590
Saikikanpatsu no Kiwami!

08:55.590 --> 08:57.380
Seven minutes.

08:57.380 --> 08:59.550
That's how long it's going to take to end this disagreement.

08:59.550 --> 09:01.960
Then you should be the one to drink this!

09:02.290 --> 09:02.970
Wai-

09:07.590 --> 09:10.470
<i>Oh, man! I don't believe it.</i>

09:10.470 --> 09:13.090
<i>From the moment I thought that to myself,</i>

09:13.090 --> 09:16.070
<i>maybe I decided what my limit was.</i>

09:26.410 --> 09:28.460
Yeah! This really is delicious!

09:28.460 --> 09:29.540
I highly recommend it!

09:30.200 --> 09:32.020
Thank you, Fuji-senpai!

09:32.020 --> 09:34.800
Oh! Seigaku easily cleared the drink too!

09:34.800 --> 09:36.730
Now they're adding meat to the grill!

09:38.050 --> 09:40.140
S-e-c-o-n-d-s!

09:40.140 --> 09:44.030
Go-Ya's a lot more bitter, so this is no problem.

09:44.030 --> 09:45.810
We're so gonna win.

09:47.480 --> 09:49.710
I'll start attacking now!

09:52.440 --> 09:56.360
Tanishi, that bastard! He's taking huge amounts of meat at one time using his tongs.

09:59.820 --> 10:02.320
Fuji, <i>what</i> is that?

10:02.320 --> 10:04.740
Just looking at it makes me lose my appetite.

10:04.740 --> 10:07.190
Don't let Higa Middle School run off on their own!

10:07.190 --> 10:08.940
Speed it up, Echizen!

10:09.550 --> 10:11.710
We're already even, Momo-senpai!

10:12.260 --> 10:13.920
Hey!

10:13.920 --> 10:14.970
You guys!

10:14.970 --> 10:16.240
Grill them more!

10:16.240 --> 10:17.850
Your grilling skills are weak!

10:17.850 --> 10:21.530
What the hell do you think the meat juices are for, you bastards!

10:21.530 --> 10:24.060
Hold on a sec! Don't get in the way, Magistrate!

10:24.460 --> 10:25.630
Kabaji.

10:25.630 --> 10:26.600
Yup.

10:30.690 --> 10:33.110
That is Tanishi's "Tong Eating"!

10:35.080 --> 10:38.070
Kabaji seems to have absorbed Tanishi's "Tong Eating"!

10:38.070 --> 10:39.450
We're so gonna win!

10:47.220 --> 10:49.860
Those two are eating too much!

10:49.860 --> 10:53.250
W-What is that, Kikumaru? Look at Shitenhouji's table.

10:53.830 --> 10:55.290
As each of them eats,

10:55.290 --> 10:58.660
Shiraishi, without any unnecessary movements,
 lays pieces of meat in the vacant spots.

10:58.660 --> 11:00.550
It's perfect! It's the Bible!

11:00.550 --> 11:03.010
It's a completely flawless grilling method!

11:04.530 --> 11:05.930
Ecstasy!

11:06.680 --> 11:09.100
There! The first ten plates are finished!

11:11.890 --> 11:16.480
Both Higa Middle School and Hyotei Gakuen have cleared ten plates!

11:16.480 --> 11:19.070
Now then, we continue on to the next drink.

11:20.090 --> 11:21.950
Penal tea.

11:21.950 --> 11:24.530
This red and spicy drink...

11:24.530 --> 11:29.410
unmistakably strikes terror into the heart of anyone who glances at it.

11:29.410 --> 11:31.500
S-e-c-o-n-d-s!

11:31.500 --> 11:33.320
He did it again in an instant...

11:33.320 --> 11:35.930
That's dreadful, Tanishi Kei.

11:36.690 --> 11:39.880
Koureeguusu is spicier.

11:39.880 --> 11:44.300
Higa has already started on their next ten plates of extremely spicy galbi!

11:44.300 --> 11:48.350
Now then, which one from Hyotei Gakuen will drink the Penal tea?

11:49.530 --> 11:51.210
I'll drink it.

11:51.180 --> 11:53.010
It's Shishido!

11:53.010 --> 11:55.010
In order to secure Hyotei's victory,

11:55.010 --> 11:58.190
there's no way we can let Kabaji go nighty-night.

11:59.230 --> 12:00.610
So manly!

12:00.610 --> 12:02.370
Shishido-san!

12:02.370 --> 12:06.870
I'll never forget just how manly you are!

12:08.060 --> 12:10.580
Farewell, Choutarou.

12:14.910 --> 12:17.460
Shishido-san!

12:20.880 --> 12:21.850
Momo!

12:21.850 --> 12:23.080
How many times do I have to tell you!?

12:23.080 --> 12:24.670
You're putting way too much sauce!

12:24.670 --> 12:27.510
The delectable taste of the meat is in its juices!

12:33.480 --> 12:36.460
Magistrate!

12:38.650 --> 12:41.150
What on earth happened to Oishi?

12:41.150 --> 12:43.240
At any rate, the interference is gone.

12:43.240 --> 12:45.110
Yeah, let's not {let}get careless.

12:45.790 --> 12:47.520
Finally, Shitenhouji and...

12:47.520 --> 12:50.030
Seigaku have cleared ten plates!

12:50.030 --> 12:53.460
Seigaku still has Fuji to drink the Penal tea.

12:54.440 --> 12:56.960
This one is also delicious.

12:56.960 --> 13:00.510
And the one to drink the Penal tea from Shitenhouji is...

13:00.510 --> 13:03.180
It's still too early for you to beat me.

13:03.180 --> 13:06.430
The copycat prince, Hitoji Yuuji!

13:07.650 --> 13:10.340
That's the perfect imitation of Fuji Shusuke!

13:10.340 --> 13:14.350
Don't tell me he can copy not only voices but tastes as well!?

13:14.970 --> 13:18.480
This drink... will disappear.

13:21.060 --> 13:23.920
You shouldn't disappear with it.

13:23.920 --> 13:28.780
As expected, copying someone's taste is impossible.

13:33.200 --> 13:34.660
Momo-senpai!

13:35.860 --> 13:39.710
Oh, no! Due to some mysterious accident, the number of losses has increased!

13:39.710 --> 13:43.090
What in the world happened to these guys!?

14:05.820 --> 14:08.240
A-A Hadoukyuu from his mouth!?

14:08.240 --> 14:10.700
Gin!

14:10.700 --> 14:14.970
I saw him, y'know. Just now, that guy put something in the food, y'know.

14:14.970 --> 14:15.910
What!?

14:15.910 --> 14:18.710
That bastard, using dirty tricks!

14:19.340 --> 14:21.550
<i>You're only realizing it now?</i>

14:21.550 --> 14:26.130
<i>Okinawa's secret spices that make up koureeguusu's true terror?</i>

14:26.130 --> 14:29.630
<i>With this our victory is certain.</i>

14:30.690 --> 14:33.970
Well then, should we change the grill soon?

14:33.970 --> 14:35.060
Leave it to me.

14:36.070 --> 14:37.020
Viking-

14:37.020 --> 14:38.890
W-Wait a second, Kai-kun!

14:38.890 --> 14:40.440
The meat on top of the grill is still-

14:40.440 --> 14:43.510
Horn!

14:47.990 --> 14:51.950
Hot!

14:51.950 --> 14:54.670
They're <i>sleeping quietly</i> because they changed the meat on the <i>grill</i>. {The pun is "ami" (grill) and "anmin" (sleep quietly).}{TL Note: Amane is punning on the words "ami" (grill) and "anmin" (sleep quietly).}

14:55.440 --> 14:58.370
That <i>idiot</i> screwed with the <i>sauce.</i> {The pun is "tare" (sauce) and "bakatare" (idiot).}{TL Note: Amane is punning on the words "tare" (sauce" and "bakatare" (idiot).}

14:58.370 --> 15:01.180
You're on a roll today, aren't ya, David.

15:01.180 --> 15:03.890
Anyway, we totally got revenge for Ojii.

15:03.890 --> 15:05.800
But we're still last, y'know.

15:08.400 --> 15:10.690
Hyotei has broken through 60 plates!

15:10.690 --> 15:12.760
Kabaji's energy is unstoppable!

15:12.760 --> 15:16.160
This time it's Hyotei who's taken the lead, huh?

15:16.160 --> 15:17.180
Bastards!

15:17.180 --> 15:22.280
What's the next drink? I, in my greatness, will personally drink it for you.

15:22.280 --> 15:24.110
This is the next drink.

15:24.110 --> 15:27.070
It also goes by the name "Koohii."{Do not change this to coffee.. it refers to something later on.}

15:27.670 --> 15:31.240
What? Isn't this just regular hot coffee?

15:31.240 --> 15:32.910
Ah! Wait a second!

15:34.370 --> 15:37.150
That isn't just regular coffee!

15:37.150 --> 15:40.880
That's right. That is "Ko O Hi I."

15:40.880 --> 15:43.790
The level of caffeine is 30 times that of regular coffee.

15:43.790 --> 15:46.200
Just how bad is that for the stomach?

15:52.180 --> 15:53.840
Atobe,

15:54.250 --> 15:58.260
you're still going for the top while just sitting there?

15:58.260 --> 16:02.220
No, I don't think he's reigning or anything like that...

16:02.220 --> 16:04.730
He merely lost consciousness. That's all.

16:08.920 --> 16:12.110
As expected from the king! What a quick recovery!

16:12.800 --> 16:14.790
And speaking of kings,

16:14.790 --> 16:17.530
the next ten plates for Hyotei will be...

16:18.730 --> 16:20.950
Sorry to have kept you waiting.

16:20.950 --> 16:22.320
There it is!

16:22.320 --> 16:25.420
The king of meats, chateaubriand!

16:25.420 --> 16:28.230
Shatoburi-an?

16:28.230 --> 16:30.380
Chateaubriand.

16:30.380 --> 16:32.530
It's a portion from the center of the cow's filet meat.

16:32.530 --> 16:37.710
Only 600g can be taken from the 4kg of filet meat per cow.

16:37.710 --> 16:39.700
It's considered the height of luxury.

16:39.700 --> 16:43.890
It's something that would never grace the mouth of commoners such as yourselves.

16:43.890 --> 16:47.810
Seriously!? We're definitely eating 60 plates!

16:47.810 --> 16:51.480
Shiraishi! I really wanna eat that too!

16:51.480 --> 16:57.230
Chateaubriand began in 19th century France.

16:57.230 --> 17:04.920
It was named after the statesman François-René de 
Chateaubriand, who ordered his personal chef to make it.

17:04.920 --> 17:10.820
It's the choicest cut from the center of the highest grade of filet meat—the tenderloin.

17:10.820 --> 17:17.080
The fleshiness that melts in your mouth is surely an art unto itself.

17:18.590 --> 17:20.460
How naive, Inui.

17:20.460 --> 17:21.390
What!?

17:21.390 --> 17:26.260
And just when I thought there was a meat good enough for my mouth.

17:26.260 --> 17:28.860
You can't deceive my insight.

17:29.250 --> 17:30.770
This is fake.

17:30.770 --> 17:32.190
Fake!?

17:33.730 --> 17:37.030
I can tell just by looking at its tenderness, which I've grown tired of from eating habitually,

17:37.030 --> 17:39.660
as well as the way the fat sits.

17:39.660 --> 17:42.580
Now then, Inui.

17:42.580 --> 17:44.540
You've never eaten it, have you?

17:45.950 --> 17:49.460
Inui, you've never eaten it before?

17:49.460 --> 17:53.820
Even though you've never eaten it, you were still acting all high and mighty?

17:53.820 --> 17:56.140
Mada mada dane. {Whatever you guys wanna put for his key phrase.. well, whatever you've put before.}

17:58.180 --> 18:01.510
The only one who knows the taste of the real thing...

18:01.510 --> 18:04.390
is my tongue.

18:04.390 --> 18:05.900
<i>I want to know...</i>

18:05.900 --> 18:07.850
<i>the taste of the real thing.</i>

18:08.550 --> 18:12.820
<i>The real data is over... there.</i>

18:12.820 --> 18:16.050
<i>Give me... data!</i>

18:21.370 --> 18:22.330
Watch out, Inui!

18:35.030 --> 18:37.660
Captain, should we change the grill?

18:37.660 --> 18:39.470
Yeah, let's do that.

18:39.470 --> 18:44.430
Now then! Seigaku, Rokkaku and Shitenhouji have finally cleared 40 plates!

18:44.430 --> 18:47.350
And the next drink is...

18:47.350 --> 18:49.810
Koura.

18:49.810 --> 18:54.060
Well, this time it's just a regular drink.

18:57.190 --> 18:59.200
Echizen!

19:00.110 --> 19:01.480
Koura.

19:01.480 --> 19:05.750
It contains the collagen-rich blood and shell of snapping turtles.

19:07.040 --> 19:08.870
Or so it says.

19:08.870 --> 19:09.960
Was that a pun!?

19:09.960 --> 19:13.920
Then why did Shiraishi and Kurobane become all energetic?

19:14.750 --> 19:16.250
Come on!

19:16.250 --> 19:18.380
Ecstasy!

19:18.380 --> 19:21.340
Tonight, we can go all night!

19:24.390 --> 19:25.760
I cannot... eat anymore.

19:25.760 --> 19:27.720
I cannot... {alpha}eat anymore.

19:27.720 --> 19:33.650
Whoa! Despite eating 70 plates, Kabaji has given up, thanks to the drink!

19:33.650 --> 19:36.010
We only have 20 minutes left.

19:36.010 --> 19:38.360
Hyotei only has Atobe-sama left, right?

19:38.360 --> 19:40.780
Here's our chance to catch up!

19:40.780 --> 19:42.380
Come, you small fries!

19:42.380 --> 19:44.530
Tezuka, let's settle things once and for all!

19:44.530 --> 19:47.430
As his deciding move,

19:47.430 --> 19:50.570
he's thrown onto the grill the galbi dipped in the jar containing a mysterious sauce!

19:51.200 --> 19:54.170
Huh? I wonder if there's a bit too much smoke.

19:54.170 --> 19:56.080
No, it's way too much.

19:56.830 --> 19:58.720
What on earth...

19:58.720 --> 19:59.550
That is...

20:00.030 --> 20:02.470
Why is Inui's name...

20:02.830 --> 20:04.440
Could this be... Inui's curse?

20:04.440 --> 20:06.430
Could this be... {alpha}Inui's curse?

20:06.430 --> 20:09.180
What is this!? It's getting in my eyes!

20:09.180 --> 20:10.350
I can't see in front of me.

20:10.350 --> 20:11.200
Everyone!

20:11.200 --> 20:12.820
The match will be postponed!

20:12.820 --> 20:14.770
Don't get careless, then head outdoors to seek shelter!

20:14.770 --> 20:20.070
I just came from eating snapping turtle in secret from the brats. {song start}

20:20.070 --> 20:22.780
Thanks to that, now my skin's very smooth.

20:22.780 --> 20:26.800
I'm going to be popular again. {song end}

20:26.800 --> 20:27.660
Huh?

20:27.660 --> 20:29.160
What the heck is this?

20:33.780 --> 20:35.540
Let's see...

20:35.540 --> 20:39.460
This is what your total comes to.

20:44.630 --> 20:48.600
One million two... hundred... thousand...

22:06.300 --> 22:09.300
I cannot... eat anymore.

22:11.700 --> 22:16.700


22:40.160 --> 22:41.250
Echizen is...?

22:41.250 --> 22:43.960
What do you mean he can't come!?

22:46.380 --> 22:49.340
It seems he's currently in Karuizawa.

22:50.510 --> 22:51.680
<i>Echizen...</i>

22:51.680 --> 22:53.600
I'm going to bring Echizen back!

22:55.060 --> 22:56.850
I understand the situation.

22:56.850 --> 22:58.480
Get on, Momoshiro!

22:58.480 --> 22:59.520
Atobe-san!

25:24.370 --> 25:25.210
Echizen!

25:25.210 --> 25:26.370
Echizen!

25:26.370 --> 25:27.880
Echizen!

25:27.880 --> 25:29.420
Shorty!

25:29.420 --> 25:30.340
Echizen!

25:30.340 --> 25:31.500
Echizen!

25:31.500 --> 25:32.590
Echizen!

25:32.590 --> 25:34.220
Echizen!

25:37.640 --> 25:39.010
I... won't forget about any of you.

25:39.010 --> 25:42.220
I... {alpha}won't forget about any of you.
